{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":35,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":3715,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1913344,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1462443269,"LastPoster":{"Id":286706,"Name":"Kcusack89","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286706.jpg?_r=1472989106","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":23,"Preview":{"Id":1913344,"PostDate":1462443269,"PostContent":"So I just realized there wasn't a dedicated Hyatt Ziva\/Zilara Rose Hall thread. I wanted to share...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427028004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.231.40.58","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a0180281bbd12d9da23adbd475e26d2f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I just realized there wasn&#039;t a dedicated Hyatt Ziva\/Zilara Rose Hall thread. I wanted to share a few things with fellow brides since it is a relatively new resort. My wedding will be on April 23, 2017 at the Hyatt Ziva. I have attached the ceremony locations, packages and a picture I found online of a ceremony set up at the sky lounge. I have been asked about the resort a few times so I would love to share what I know with others who may be in the early stages!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913344,"PostDate":1462443269,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I just realized there wasn't a dedicated Hyatt Ziva\/Zilara Rose Hall thread. I wanted to share a few things with fellow brides since it is a relatively new resort. My wedding will be on April 23, 2017 at the Hyatt Ziva. I have attached the ceremony locations, packages and a picture I found online of a ceremony set up at the sky lounge. I have been asked about the resort a few times so I would love to share what I know with others who may be in the early stages!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=35637\" title=\"Download attachment\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_extra\/mime_types\/pdf.gif\" alt=\"Attached File\" \/><\/a>\n&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=35637\" title=\"Download attachment\"><strong>Hyatt Ziva  Wedding Locations .pdf<\/strong><\/a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class='desc'><strong>563.5KB<\/strong><\/span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"desc lighter\">13 downloads<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=35638\" title=\"Download attachment\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_extra\/mime_types\/pdf.gif\" alt=\"Attached File\" \/><\/a>\n&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=35638\" title=\"Download attachment\"><strong>Hyatt Ziva &amp; Zilara Wedding Brochure.pdf<\/strong><\/a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class='desc'><strong>1.06MB<\/strong><\/span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"desc lighter\">13 downloads<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1913344]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-282503-0-91638700-1462457599.jpeg\" title=\"montego-bay-jamaica.jpeg - Size: 63.95KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-282503-0-91638700-1462457599.jpeg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"montego-bay-jamaica.jpeg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427028004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"146.18.173.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0157d02799539f31dd49342bb2d4ff88","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I hope your wedding was beautiful! &amp;nbsp;i am getting married there September 17, 2016! &amp;nbsp;it has been really difficult to find information, although my coordinator Donisha has been very helpful. &amp;nbsp;Would love any and all tips and suggested locations on your return! &amp;nbsp;Congrats!!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Just realized it is next year! &amp;nbsp;I will share whatever I find then! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;:)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913443,"PostDate":1462804750,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I hope your wedding was beautiful! \u00a0i am getting married there September 17, 2016! \u00a0it has been really difficult to find information, although my coordinator Donisha has been very helpful. \u00a0Would love any and all tips and suggested locations on your return! \u00a0Congrats!!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p>Just realized it is next year! \u00a0I will share whatever I find then! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"toyal@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"98.26.1.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441276377,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Toyal","Id":284663,"Name":"Toyal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.231.40.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e307514b15da5f5db284d3274080c67d","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"Toyal\"]!\n\nI&#039;m so happy to see another Ziva bride!  How has the process been for you so far? Do you know if you&#039;re going to be bringing a lot of things from home or will you be using their decor? How many guests are you expecting?\n\nI haven&#039;t been able to start the planning portion yet but I should be hearing from my coordinator Julianne soon about that. I&#039;m hoping I won&#039;t have more than 80 guests but we are looking to invite about 130 so we&#039;ll see.","Attachments":[],"Id":1913455,"PostDate":1462828639,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284663\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284663-toyal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Toyal<\/span><\/a>!<br>\nI'm so happy to see another Ziva bride!  How has the process been for you so far? Do you know if you're going to be bringing a lot of things from home or will you be using their decor? How many guests are you expecting?<br>\nI haven't been able to start the planning portion yet but I should be hearing from my coordinator Julianne soon about that. I'm hoping I won't have more than 80 guests but we are looking to invite about 130 so we'll see.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427028004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.147.88.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be5792c2b3d2eacb60633de639535a17","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies. My wedding is at ziva on May 13th. Have you been in contact with the wedding planners yet? I may be able to provide some insite&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913681,"PostDate":1463071466,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies. My wedding is at ziva on May 13th. Have you been in contact with the wedding planners yet? I may be able to provide some insite<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kcusack89@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.245.61.215","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460394513,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286706.jpg?_r=1472989106","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Kcusack89","Id":286706,"Name":"Kcusack89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.7.145.170","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"900789d7bf5de77a5f64bca510668a87","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am so glad this was created. I am getting married on 8\/20\/2016. I will be having a small group of 30 on the rooftop for the ceremony and in the ballroom for the reception (it&#039;s too hot to be outside in Aug).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I wanted to know about the dj. I know this can make or break the atmosphere so if anyone has used the hotel dj please let me know.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Kcusack89\"] Congrats how was your wedding?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913907,"PostDate":1463760127,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am so glad this was created. I am getting married on 8\/20\/2016. I will be having a small group of 30 on the rooftop for the ceremony and in the ballroom for the reception (it's too hot to be outside in Aug).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I wanted to know about the dj. I know this can make or break the atmosphere so if anyone has used the hotel dj please let me know.\u00a0<\/p