e":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.66.81.218","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fbd050a95ce2892e9af5959305266309","RawContent":"I just got the entertainment list with prices. There&#039;s a listing for \"DJ\" then \"Dj with sound system\". Anyone ask about this? If we choose \"DJ\" is there not a sound system included? Just wanted to find out before I ask my coordinator.","Attachments":[],"Id":1914080,"PostDate":1464639951,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just got the entertainment list with prices. There's a listing for \"DJ\" then \"Dj with sound system\". Anyone ask about this? If we choose \"DJ\" is there not a sound system included? Just wanted to find out before I ask my coordinator. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427028004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.147.88.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f106308f64ab2ba6743d372aad64f705","RawContent":"On mine it&#039;s DJ (Disco) 375 with 16.5% entertainment fee. But I&#039;m pretty sure the 375 is 2016 rate. But I confirmed with my coordinator that that&#039;s the right DJ. Did you get 2017 rate prices?","Attachments":[],"Id":1914081,"PostDate":1464643276,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                On mine it's DJ (Disco) 375 with 16.5% entertainment fee. But I'm pretty sure the 375 is 2016 rate. But I confirmed with my coordinator that that's the right DJ. Did you get 2017 rate prices?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kcusack89@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.245.61.215","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460394513,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286706.jpg?_r=1472989106","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Kcusack89","Id":286706,"Name":"Kcusack89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.202.203.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d1528b2402d237ea7ddb234122e5ff29","RawContent":"It says 2016 but I&#039;m sure it&#039;s 2017 since it&#039;s a little higher because the rate listed for DJ is $400 and DJ with sound system is $485.","Attachments":[],"Id":1914089,"PostDate":1464682738,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                It says 2016 but I'm sure it's 2017 since it's a little higher because the rate listed for DJ is $400 and DJ with sound system is $485.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427028004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.245.61.215","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f3c717079f93266aa059531cfa8f3719","RawContent":"Lol well looks like my coordinator is behind the times I&#039;ll have to get the updated list. I&#039;d assume it would be the DJ with sounds system. The other may just be an MC type deal","Attachments":[],"Id":1914090,"PostDate":1464682878,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Lol well looks like my coordinator is behind the times I'll have to get the updated list. I'd assume it would be the DJ with sounds system. The other may just be an MC type deal\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kcusack89@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.245.61.215","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460394513,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286706.jpg?_r=1472989106","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Kcusack89","Id":286706,"Name":"Kcusack89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.202.203.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fbd0ad404f35402d9278b61aabad453c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yeah, that probably makes sense because I was wondering where the cost for the MC was. Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914092,"PostDate":1464690500,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yeah, that probably makes sense because I was wondering where the cost for the MC was. Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427028004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.191.90.152","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e652aa1ac072cfc7afa99ba8643f902f","RawContent":"Hi everyone,\n\n\nAre any of you bringing your own decorations etc? For example for the table centre pieces or using a local flower shop for bridesmaid bouquets?\n\n\nI&#039;m curious how much will be organized on your own.\n\nThanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1914364,"PostDate":1465833427,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone,<br><br>\nAre any of you bringing your own decorations etc? For example for the table centre pieces or using a local flower shop for bridesmaid bouquets?<br><br>\nI'm curious how much will be organized on your own.<br>\nThanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tiannef1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.191.90.152","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465832936,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Mzt247","Id":287152,"Name":"Mzt247","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.83.176","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca4350b29e1ece5152435728fa460890","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"Mzt247\"],\n\nI actually just emailed my coordinator last night asking prices for a few centerpieces that I like in the booklet she sent me. Depending on how much they are will determine if I bring my own or use theres. I am bringing my own chair ties though, they charge $4 per chair but I can get them so much cheaper online.","Attachments":[],"Id":1914366,"PostDate":1465834534,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287152\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287152-mzt247\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mzt247<\/span><\/a>,<br>\nI actually just emailed my coordinator last night asking prices for a few centerpieces that I like in the booklet she sent me. Depending on how much they are will determine if I bring my own or use theres. I am bringing my own chair ties though, they charge $4 per chair but I can get them so much cheaper online.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427028004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.231.40.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b293227e2a11ea48d82ed37b137950c","RawContent":"Okay, so my wedding coordinator got back to me. The centerpieces I asked her about are $65 and $50 each. So I&#039;ll be bringing my own. I&#039;m planning on having to use at least 8 tables so those prices are way over my budget.","Attachments":[],"Id":1914378,"PostDate":1465857206,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Okay, so my wedding coordinator got back to me. The centerpieces I asked her about are $65 and $50 each. So I'll be bringing my own. I'm planning on having to use at least 8 tables so those prices are way over my budget.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427028004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.191.90.152","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47f88849e2d05f6f8cdea47a1beae362","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tiffanyt\" post=\"1914366\" timestamp=\"1465848934\"]\nHi @[member=\"Mzt247\"],\nI actually just emailed my coordinator last night asking prices for a few centerpieces that I like in the booklet she sent me. Depending on how much they are will determine if I bring my own or use theres. I am bringing my own chair ties though, they charge $4 per chair but I can get them so much cheaper online.[\/quote]\nThanks so much for all of the information! @[member=\"tiffanyt\"]\nWill your chair ties be used for the reception or on the ceremony chairs? Our ceremony will be at the skylounge which I noticed in the photo didn&#039;t have any chair ties.","Attachments":[],"Id":1914379,"PostDate":1465872872,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tiffanyt, on 13 June 2016 - 04:15 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287152\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287152-mzt247\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mzt247<\/span><\/a>,<br>\nI actually just emailed my coordinator last night asking prices for a few centerpieces that I like in the booklet she sent me. Depending on how much they are will determine if I bring my own or use theres. I am bringing my own chair ties though, they charge $4 per chair but I can get them so much cheaper online.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nThanks so much for all of the information! @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282503\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282503-tiffanyt\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tiffanyt<\/span><\/a><br>\nWill your chair ties be used for the reception or on the ceremony chairs? Our ceremony will be at the skylounge which I noticed in the photo didn't have any chair ties.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tiannef1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.191.90.152","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465832936,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Mzt247","Id":287152,"Name":"Mzt247","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":35,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
