{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.245.61.215","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe0bb10589937f873f9e29ff81b78ebe","RawContent":"Wear are you getting your ties?? I&#039;m doing the same thing. I just got the floral booklet so I&#039;ll have to ask for prices bow...i didn&#039;t think they&#039;d be that high :( I only want something small\n\nI did book a big day preview ! Won&#039;t be going til October but I&#039;ll be sure to gather everyone questions before then!","Attachments":[],"Id":1914381,"PostDate":1465887194,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wear are you getting your ties?? I'm doing the same thing. I just got the floral booklet so I'll have to ask for prices bow...i didn't think they'd be that high <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> I only want something small<br>\nI did book a big day preview ! Won't be going til October but I'll be sure to gather everyone questions before then!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kcusack89@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.245.61.215","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460394513,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286706.jpg?_r=1472989106","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Kcusack89","Id":286706,"Name":"Kcusack89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.202.203.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d506d49dd84c9ec7f1f1bee85149d5e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Mzt247\"] I&#039;m definitely using them for the ceremony, haven&#039;t decided if I want to use them for the the reception yet, but I probably will. I&#039;m also having mine at the sky lounge and since I&#039;m not doing much else for decor other than what is included and rose petals to line the aisle (which I&#039;m also bringing) then I wanted to add something else so I think the chair ties will be a good addition.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Kcusack89\"] I haven&#039;t ordered them yet because I&#039;m not sure how many to get but I&#039;ve been looking at a few of the sites that former brides have suggested&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;ebay&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.weddinglinensdirect.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.weddinglinensdirect.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve also done a few google searches and found some reasonable prices on other sites as well!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914387,"PostDate":1465906689,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287152\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287152-mzt247\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mzt247<\/span><\/a> I'm definitely using them for the ceremony, haven't decided if I want to use them for the the reception yet, but I probably will. I'm also having mine at the sky lounge and since I'm not doing much else for decor other than what is included and rose petals to line the aisle (which I'm also bringing) then I wanted to add something else so I think the chair ties will be a good addition.<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286706\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/286706-kcusack89\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Kcusack89<\/span><\/a> I haven't ordered them yet because I'm not sure how many to get but I've been looking at a few of the sites that former brides have suggested<\/p>\n<p>ebay<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddinglinensdirect.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddinglinensdirect.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>I've also done a few google searches and found some reasonable prices on other sites as well!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427028004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.7.145.170","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"878459f4e71382aa95a373b93f5b3f48","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tiffanyt\" post=\"1914041\" timestamp=\"1464323003\"]\n@[member=\"jjbrown\"] Do you know about the cost for extras? I&#039;m trying to figure out if it would make sense to use their bouquets for my bridesmaids or bring preserved flowers imstead?[\/quote]Hi Tiffany,\n\nI&#039;m not sure about the flowers. I will be using an outside vendor my sister found. It ends up being cheaper than Tai Flora even with the Vendor fee. You should ask to see pictures of their bouquets. \n\nPlease know if you are having your wedding inside the ballroom you will need to pay for a dancefloor and lighting as it is dark. Also, decorations will add up. We will end up bringing a lot of it ourselves.","Attachments":[],"Id":1914829,"PostDate":1468343472,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tiffanyt, on 27 May 2016 - 12:23 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281313\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281313-jjbrown\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jjbrown<\/span><\/a> Do you know about the cost for extras? I'm trying to figure out if it would make sense to use their bouquets for my bridesmaids or bring preserved flowers imstead?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi Tiffany,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm not sure about the flowers. I will be using an outside vendor my sister found. It ends up being cheaper than Tai Flora even with the Vendor fee. You should ask to see pictures of their bouquets.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Please know if you are having your wedding inside the ballroom you will need to pay for a dancefloor and lighting as it is dark. Also, decorations will add up. We will end up bringing a lot of it ourselves.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jajames83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.194.134.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417700906,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jjbrown","Id":281313,"Name":"jjbrown","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.202.203.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7aaf220fd63df8de4719817c991a9622","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"jjbrown\"],&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Yeah, I asked about prices for the things she sent me in the packet and they were ridiculously priced, so we decided to bring many thing ourselves too. My reception will be on the decks and I still need lighting, good thing I asked, or else who knows if they would have told me. What company are you using?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914845,"PostDate":1468404831,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281313\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281313-jjbrown\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jjbrown<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>Yeah, I asked about prices for the things she sent me in the packet and they were ridiculously priced, so we decided to bring many thing ourselves too. My reception will be on the decks and I still need lighting, good thing I asked, or else who knows if they would have told me. What company are you using?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427028004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.7.145.170","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87c041239cd63f0df0599f80cefb8299","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tiffanyt\" post=\"1914845\" timestamp=\"1468419231\"]\nHi @[member=\"jjbrown\"],\nYeah, I asked about prices for the things she sent me in the packet and they were ridiculously priced, so we decided to bring many thing ourselves too. My reception will be on the decks and I still need lighting, good thing I asked, or else who knows if they would have told me. What company are you using?[\/quote]@[member=\"tiffanyt\"] The florist we&#039;re using is actually supplying our dance floor and the lights (so we can only pay 1 vendor fee). Her name is Donna Dally Floral Design PM if you want her contact info. I&#039;ll post tons of pictures when i have the ceremony.\n\nJ","Attachments":[],"Id":1914877,"PostDate":1468581401,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tiffanyt, on 13 July 2016 - 10:13 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281313\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281313-jjbrown\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jjbrown<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>Yeah, I asked about prices for the things she sent me in the packet and they were ridiculously priced, so we decided to bring many thing ourselves too. My reception will be on the decks and I still need lighting, good thing I asked, or else who knows if they would have told me. What company are you using?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282503\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282503-tiffanyt\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tiffanyt<\/span><\/a> The florist we're using is actually supplying our dance floor and the lights (so we can only pay 1 vendor fee). Her name is Donna Dally Floral Design PM if you want her contact info. I'll post tons of pictures when i have the ceremony.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>J<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jajames83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.194.134.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417700906,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jjbrown","Id":281313,"Name":"jjbrown","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.252.99.13","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c4a75aaa791fe93f2f75511ac4162da3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi brides. I&#039;m considering Hyatt ZIva Cancun for my November 2017 wedding. @[member=\"jjbrown\"] could you please send me your florist&#039;s info? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914982,"PostDate":1469204590,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi brides. I'm considering Hyatt ZIva Cancun for my November 2017 wedding. @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281313\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281313-jjbrown\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jjbrown<\/span><\/a> could you please send me your florist's info? \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessgar86@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.252.99.13","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460641963,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jessgar86","Id":286726,"Name":"jessgar86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.191.90.152","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd73e140ce7193e5b2b6e77f0007a9e7","RawContent":"Hi, @[member=\"jjbrown\"]\n\nI also sent you a PM for the contact info for Donna Dally your florist.\n\nThanks!\n\nIs anyone else using outside vendors that you&#039;d recommend?\n\n[quote name=\"jjbrown\" post=\"1914877\" timestamp=\"1468595801\"]\n@[member=\"tiffanyt\"] The florist we&#039;re using is actually supplying our dance floor and the lights (so we can only pay 1 vendor fee). Her name is Donna Dally Floral Design PM if you want her contact info. I&#039;ll post tons of pictures when i have the ceremony.\n \nJ[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1914985,"PostDate":1469211223,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi, @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281313\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281313-jjbrown\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jjbrown<\/span><\/a><br><br>\nI also sent you a PM for the contact info for Donna Dally your florist.<br><br>\nThanks!<br><br>\nIs anyone else using outside vendors that you'd recommend?<br><br><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jjbrown, on 15 July 2016 - 11:16 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282503\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282503-tiffanyt\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tiffanyt<\/span><\/a> The florist we're using is actually supplying our dance floor and the lights (so we can only pay 1 vendor fee). Her name is Donna Dally Floral Design PM if you want her contact info. I'll post tons of pictures when i have the ceremony.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nJ<\/p><\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tiannef1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.191.90.152","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465832936,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Mzt247","Id":287152,"Name":"Mzt247","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.104.232.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"514282efe52b075e0b4c1be6ce986b6a","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"jessgar86\"] \n\nI&#039;m also thinking about the Ziva Cancun for November 2017. Have you been given any rates? It seems like the regular room rates increase drastically next year, but maybe they will have the same current promotion and rates.\n\n\nSent from my SM-G900V using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1914991,"PostDate":1469218853,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286726\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/286726-jessgar86\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jessgar86<\/span><\/a> <br>\nI'm also thinking about the Ziva Cancun for November 2017. Have you been given any rates? It seems like the regular room rates increase drastically next year, but maybe they will have the same current promotion and rates.<br><br>\nSent from my SM-G900V using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebeccarpeck@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.194.211.78","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1447408212,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rebeccarpeck","Id":285328,"Name":"rebeccarpeck","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.119.8.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1b7fdda8ad0661a570c96a012597c8d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Mzt247\" post=\"1914985\" timestamp=\"1469225623\"]\nHi, @[member=\"jjbrown\"]\n\nI also sent you a PM for the contact info for Donna Dally your florist.\n\nThanks!\n\nIs anyone else using outside vendors that you&#039;d recommend?\n[\/quote]I just messaged you :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1914992,"PostDate":1469220891,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Mzt247, on 22 July 2016 - 06:13 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi, @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281313\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281313-jjbrown\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jjbrown<\/span><\/a><br><br>\nI also sent you a PM for the contact info for Donna Dally your florist.<br><br>\nThanks!<br><br>\nIs anyone else using outside vendors that you'd recommend?<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I just messaged you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jajames83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.194.134.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417700906,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jjbrown","Id":281313,"Name":"jjbrown","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.28.30.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f02837a91d508b7d5148eae829c2ce4e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jjbrown\"]. I haven&#039;t been given any rates. We going to visit in October to look at a few different locations. Have you already gone to visit the actual hotel?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915159,"PostDate":1470319291,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281313\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281313-jjbrown\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jjbrown<\/span><\/a>. I haven't been given any rates. We going to visit in October to look at a few different locations. Have you already gone to visit the actual hotel?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessgar86@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.252.99.13","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460641963,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destinatio