{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.202.203.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6fb9837c9591899ff41c3d06028b171","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"jessgar86\"],&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;are you getting married in Cancun or Jamaica? I went to the Jamaica location in March for the big day preview and loved it. But if you&#039;re getting married in Cancun the rates are a little different, there&#039;s another thread for that resort.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915176,"PostDate":1470393579,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286726\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/286726-jessgar86\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jessgar86<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>are you getting married in Cancun or Jamaica? I went to the Jamaica location in March for the big day preview and loved it. But if you're getting married in Cancun the rates are a little different, there's another thread for that resort.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427028004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.76.207.178","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1471345512,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ca20189500ccfeb27cf5da7279cbb96","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You all so lovely&amp;nbsp; :wub:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915306,"PostDate":1471345484,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You all so lovely\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vstn@mail.com","IpAddress":"95.76.207.178","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1470888342,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"CoolSmile","Id":287545,"Name":"CoolSmile","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.66.81.218","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"05b377bd316f09f0ec1cbb56e4280115","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyone hearing concerns or complaints about the fee our guests have to pay to attend the wedding if they are not staying at the resort?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915383,"PostDate":1471811335,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies,<\/p>\n<p>Anyone hearing concerns or complaints about the fee our guests have to pay to attend the wedding if they are not staying at the resort?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427028004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.191.90.152","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef4491df5086f51a2d46bfa4893d6165","RawContent":"Anyone else using outside vendors for flowers,  dance floor\/decor etc? Any suggestions?","Attachments":[],"Id":1915525,"PostDate":1472686931,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Anyone else using outside vendors for flowers,  dance floor\/decor etc? Any suggestions?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tiannef1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.191.90.152","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465832936,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Mzt247","Id":287152,"Name":"Mzt247","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.246.178.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80074,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aafe9e886697b6e39d3acdc3a4fda496","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Tiffany, ive gotten complains. My fiance&#039;s mom doesn&#039;t want to stay at zilara and is complaining about the $100 outside fee to attend. I personally have about had it with her and her complaints so I&#039;m not even offering to pay it for her. We offered her a COMP ROOM and she denied it. Every other guest is staying on location for at least the wedding several others are just staying the 3 night min then going to another hotel.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As far as vendors I haven&#039;t booked anything but photography with an outside company and they cover the fee or i have to just pay $100 i can&#039;t remember =) I&#039;m going down the first wee in October for our big day preview so I can ask some questions if anyone has some&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915547,"PostDate":1472912493,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Tiffany, ive gotten complains. My fiance's mom doesn't want to stay at zilara and is complaining about the $100 outside fee to attend. I personally have about had it with her and her complaints so I'm not even offering to pay it for her. We offered her a COMP ROOM and she denied it. Every other guest is staying on location for at least the wedding several others are just staying the 3 night min then going to another hotel.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As far as vendors I haven't booked anything but photography with an outside company and they cover the fee or i have to just pay $100 i can't remember =) I'm going down the first wee in October for our big day preview so I can ask some questions if anyone has some<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kcusack89@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.245.61.215","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460394513,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286706.jpg?_r=1472989106","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Kcusack89","Id":286706,"Name":"Kcusack89","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":35,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
